<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Avonmore, Waterford get approval to merge.</title>
<headline>Avonmore, Waterford get approval to merge.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Farmer shareholders in Avonmore Foods Plc and Waterford Foods Plc on Friday gave final approval to a merger between the two Irish dairy giants, an Avonmore spokesman said.</p>
</text>
